WEBVTT

00:07.457 --> 00:07.618
Hmm.

00:38.092 --> 00:41.794
Turning the dial, looking for a voice

00:45.196 --> 00:49.879
In the static haze, we make a choice

00:52.960 --> 00:58.163
A million signals crossing in the dark

00:59.504 --> 01:07.876
Waiting for the one to ignite the spark Static on

01:07.896 --> 01:15.040
the wire Cutting through the night Searching

01:15.100 --> 01:19.803
for a frequency Hiding out of sight We're

01:21.584 --> 01:29.989
talking in the echoes Fading in the blue Static

01:30.189 --> 01:34.192
on the wire Trying to get to you

01:41.470 --> 01:45.473
The satellites are spinning overhead

01:48.915 --> 01:56.080
Catching every word we never said A broken

01:56.140 --> 02:00.443
transmission on a steady loop

02:03.370 --> 02:08.853
We're caught inside the rhythm of the groove

02:10.334 --> 02:15.736
Static on the wire Cutting through the night

02:17.777 --> 02:23.160
Searching for a frequency Hiding out of sight

02:23.180 --> 02:30.664
We're talking in the echoes Fading in the blue

02:32.650 --> 02:36.471
Static

02:36.791 --> 02:45.813
on the wire. Trying to get to you. Signal lost.

02:45.933 --> 02:53.675
Signal found. Keep your feet on the ground. Turn

02:53.756 --> 02:55.636
it up. Break the sound.

03:28.339 --> 03:33.803
Static on the wire Cutting through the night

03:35.825 --> 03:41.329
Searching for a frequency Hiding out of sight

03:42.990 --> 03:48.874
We're talking in the echoes Fading in the blue

03:50.655 --> 03:55.519
Static on the wire Trying to get to you

04:09.119 --> 04:11.324
Static on the wire

